      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that, but honestly it's a bit too plain. it's missing that 'punch' that actually stops people from scrolling. \n\nthe marketing lead just looked at the draft and said it feels a bit generic. i know i said don't overdo it, but we really need to hit those engagement markers to get the algorithm to pick it up. can you try another version? just try to make it feel more high-energy and 'internet native'. even if the engagement score goes up a bit, as long as it doesn't sound like a robot wrote it, it's fine. just aim for a higher score than the last one while keeping it somewhat natural.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
